nicolasmateos.com

This repository holds two different things, and they are not under the same
terms. The code is open: fork it, read it, build your own site with it. The
content and the brand are not.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. THE CODE - MIT LICENSE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This part covers the source code of the site: the build configuration and the
scripts (astro.config.mjs, wrangler.jsonc, content.config.ts, scripts/), the
components, views, pages, layouts and libraries under src/ (.astro, .ts, .js),
the styles in src/styles/, the client script in src/scripts/, and the Checkout
Lab interface in public/assets/js/.

